[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5289.669, "timestamp": "01:28:09", "text": "ニース。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5299.11, "timestamp": "01:28:19", "text": "167 の件は本当に良かったよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5302.149, "timestamp": "01:28:22", "text": "君は自慢してるよ、兄弟。 いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5304.47, "timestamp": "01:28:24", "text": "ムンバイのサーバーでもだよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5307.189, "timestamp": "01:28:27", "text": "いや、でも私はこのゲームが下手なんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5310.39, "timestamp": "01:28:30", "text": "いや、君が悪いなら、僕は悪くない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5313.03, "timestamp": "01:28:33", "text": "君が悪いと感じているなら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5316.79, "timestamp": "01:28:36", "text": "それはただの運だと思うよ。 わからない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5320.149, "timestamp": "01:28:40", "text": "もしあなたが「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5323.03, "timestamp": "01:28:43", "text": "ああ、そうだ」と同じくらい悪いなら。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5323.91, "timestamp": "01:28:43", "text": "適切な言葉が揃っている。"}]